{
    "title": "Digital Gradient WF Wear OS 4+",
    "description": "NOTICE: READ THIS ALWAYS BEFORE AND AFTER DOWNLOADING OUR WATCH FACE TO AVOID ANY SITUATION YOU DON'T LIKE.\r\n\r\nThis watch face for WEAR OS has been made in Samsung Galaxy Watch face studio which is still evolving and has been tested on Samsung Watch 4 Classic , Samsung Watch 5 Pro, and Tic watch 5 Pro. It also supports other wear os 3+ devices. Some feature experience can be slightly different on other watches. \r\n\r\nINSTALLATION NOTE: TO INSTALL THE WATCH FACE PART JUST INSTALL HELPER APP FROM PHONE PLAY STORE APP THEN OPEN THIS APP & TOUCH ANYWHERE ON SCREEN IT WILL OPEN THE WATCH FACE ON YOUR CONNECTED SMARTWATCH THEN JUST PRESS INSTALL & IT WILL INSTALL THE WATCH FACE ON YOUR WATCH . THE HELPER APP ON PHONE PLAY STORE APP IS TO FACILITATE YOU TO INSTALL IT EASILY. YOU CAN ALSO USE INSTALLER DROP DOWN BUTTON TO DIRECTLY INSTALL ON YOUR WATCH.\r\n\r\na. This watch face has 12H/24H Mode both options. The watch face follows whatever time option is selected on your connected phone and incase not connected to phone then it follows your watch time mode option selected on your watch.  The 24H Mode has a distinct leading Zero for hours text. The 12H Mode has No leading Zero for Hours Text. So choose whatever you like on your watch.\r\n\r\nb. This watch face contains a lot of options in customization menu.If for some reason on Samsung Watches Galaxy wearable app force closes while you are trying to customize that is due to a bug in Galaxy Wearable app last update. Try 2 to 3 times while opening on Galaxy wearable app and customization menu will also open there as well.This has got nothing to do with the watch face. This behavior doesn't occur on Ticwatch Mobvoi Health app.\r\n\r\nThe watch face has following features:-\r\n\r\n1.10x Background styles including default are available for Hours digits text select-able via customization menu. which will follow normal 30 x color styles option . And then 9 x gradient styles .\r\n\r\n2. 10x Background styles including default are available for Minutes digits text select-able via customization menu. which will follow normal 30 x color styles option . And then 9 x gradient styles. \r\n\r\n3. Seconds time is shown by a glowing dot rotating around in circle . there are two type of movements that you can select from customization menu.\r\n\r\n4. Center left & Right Complications & Battery/ Steps Complication can be hidden/Unhidden from customization menu for Main Display.\r\n\r\n5. AM/PM/24H/Date/Day/Month Text you can hide/unhide on main display from customization menu .An option has been added for it.\r\n\r\n6. An Option has been added for Always On Display in customization menu with which you can select Min/Max AoD Style .\r\n\r\n7. 6 x customizable Complications are also available for main display. And they are switched off on AOD. You can also switch On/Off them from complication customization menu option for main display.\r\n\r\n8. Tap On Battery Icon/Text to open watch battery settings menu.\r\n\r\n9. Tap On AM/PM/24H Text to open watch phone dialer menu.\r\n\r\n10. Tap On Date Text to open watch main settings  menu.\r\n\r\n11. Tap On Day Text to open watch Alarm application menu.\r\n\r\n12. Tap On Month Text to open watch Calendar application menu.",
    "descriptionHTML": "NOTICE: READ THIS ALWAYS BEFORE AND AFTER DOWNLOADING OUR WATCH FACE TO AVOID ANY SITUATION YOU DON&#39;T LIKE.<br><br>This watch face for WEAR OS has been made in Samsung Galaxy Watch face studio which is still evolving and has been tested on Samsung Watch 4 Classic , Samsung Watch 5 Pro, and Tic watch 5 Pro. It also supports other wear os 3+ devices. Some feature experience can be slightly different on other watches. <br><br>INSTALLATION NOTE: TO INSTALL THE WATCH FACE PART JUST INSTALL HELPER APP FROM PHONE PLAY STORE APP THEN OPEN THIS APP &amp; TOUCH ANYWHERE ON SCREEN IT WILL OPEN THE WATCH FACE ON YOUR CONNECTED SMARTWATCH THEN JUST PRESS INSTALL &amp; IT WILL INSTALL THE WATCH FACE ON YOUR WATCH . THE HELPER APP ON PHONE PLAY STORE APP IS TO FACILITATE YOU TO INSTALL IT EASILY. YOU CAN ALSO USE INSTALLER DROP DOWN BUTTON TO DIRECTLY INSTALL ON YOUR WATCH.<br><br>a. This watch face has 12H/24H Mode both options. The watch face follows whatever time option is selected on your connected phone and incase not connected to phone then it follows your watch time mode option selected on your watch.  The 24H Mode has a distinct leading Zero for hours text. The 12H Mode has No leading Zero for Hours Text. So choose whatever you like on your watch.<br><br>b. This watch face contains a lot of options in customization menu.If for some reason on Samsung Watches Galaxy wearable app force closes while you are trying to customize that is due to a bug in Galaxy Wearable app last update. Try 2 to 3 times while opening on Galaxy wearable app and customization menu will also open there as well.This has got nothing to do with the watch face. This behavior doesn&#39;t occur on Ticwatch Mobvoi Health app.<br><br>The watch face has following features:-<br><br>1.10x Background styles including default are available for Hours digits text select-able via customization menu. which will follow normal 30 x color styles option . And then 9 x gradient styles .<br><br>2. 10x Background styles including default are available for Minutes digits text select-able via customization menu. which will follow normal 30 x color styles option . And then 9 x gradient styles. <br><br>3. Seconds time is shown by a glowing dot rotating around in circle . there are two type of movements that you can select from customization menu.<br><br>4. Center left &amp; Right Complications &amp; Battery/ Steps Complication can be hidden/Unhidden from customization menu for Main Display.<br><br>5. AM/PM/24H/Date/Day/Month Text you can hide/unhide on main display from customization menu .An option has been added for it.<br><br>6. An Option has been added for Always On Display in customization menu with which you can select Min/Max AoD Style .<br><br>7. 6 x customizable Complications are also available for main display. And they are switched off on AOD. You can also switch On/Off them from complication customization menu option for main display.<br><br>8. Tap On Battery Icon/Text to open watch battery settings menu.<br><br>9. Tap On AM/PM/24H Text to open watch phone dialer menu.<br><br>10. Tap On Date Text to open watch main settings  menu.<br><br>11. Tap On Day Text to open watch Alarm application menu.<br><br>12. Tap On Month Text to open watch Calendar application menu.",
